# Copy to `.env` to override. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.

# Where Argonaut's window should be drawn. Leave unset (the default) to run the
# container headless - builds and `dotnet test` need no display at all.
#
#   Linux  : DISPLAY=:0        (the X11 socket is already bind-mounted)
#   Windows: DISPLAY=host.docker.internal:0.0   with VcXsrv/X410 running
#   macOS  : DISPLAY=host.docker.internal:0     with XQuartz running and
#            "Allow connections from network clients" enabled
# DISPLAY=:0

# What the container runs instead of idling. Handy for one-shot use, e.g. CI:
# DEV_COMMAND=dotnet test Argonaut.Tests/Argonaut.Tests.csproj
